---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Minepedia privacy policy: what data is collected (Cloudflare Web Analytics, future ads), cookies, and your rights." canonicalPath="/privacy/" lang="en" altPath="/es/privacy/">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</nav>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: September 22, 2026.</em></p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Minepedia is a static website. We do not run user accounts, we do not ask for personal data, and we do not use tracking cookies of our own.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> we use Cloudflare Web Analytics, a privacy-first, cookieless measurement service. It collects aggregated page-view and performance data (pages visited, approximate country, device type, load times). It does not track individual users across sites and does not use cookies.</li>
      <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> like any website, our hosting provider (Cloudflare) processes IP addresses and user agents to deliver pages and protect against abuse.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> the contact form opens your own email application. Messages you send us by email are kept only as long as needed to answer you.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>If advertising is enabled in the future (for example Google AdSense), third-party vendors including Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/">Google Ads Settings</a> and at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">aboutads.info</a>. This section will be updated before any ads go live.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the GDPR you have the right to access, correct or delete personal data we hold about you (in practice, only emails you sent us). Write to <a href="mailto:contact@minepedia.app">contact@minepedia.app</a> for any privacy request.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Minepedia is a general-audience information site. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>Any change to this policy will be posted on this page with a new date.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
